      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is there a reason we need dst bit for buffers? Can\u0027t we always depend on the memory objects and binding during the load time? If adding src bit only would improve the situation for Chrome\u0027s stability, I would prefer adding it unconditionally here to be able to save the data and avoid different behavior based on the buffer properties.",
