      "writtenOn": "2024-06-04T20:15:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Adding it unconditionally or not adding it will both fail. (They fail differently, though.) The only situation that works is to add it for non-uniform buffers and not add it for uniform buffers, and I don\u0027t really know why (neither validation layer nor logcat tells me anything useful).\n\n(For some reason, all uniform buffers come with no transfer bits.)\n\nIf I add it unconditionally, it crashes chrome after 10~20 seconds with no complaints from validation layer. If I do not add anything, snapshot seems to fail to capture some buffer content.",
      "parentUuid": "742cee48_87428552",
      "revId": "702980dcfdb97295afef79419a3769934de15e95",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
